WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
I used to want to save the world.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.300
But the closer you get

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.220
the more you see the great darkness within.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.856
What is your mission?

00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:14.920
To stop the war.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:15.760
What war?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.940
The war to end all wars.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.040
I cannot stand by while innocent lives are lost.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.920
Be careful, Diana.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.100
Who is this woman?

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.660
She is my, umm... secretary, Sir.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.040
She's a very good secretary.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.240
It is our sacred duty to defend the world

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.040
and that's what I'm going to do.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.380
I used to want to save the world.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.680
This beautiful place.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:20.000
But the closer you get

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:23.600
the more you see the great darkness whitin.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.500
I learned this the hard way

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.440
a long, long time ago.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.820
What is your mission?

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:50.000
To stop the war.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.780
What war?

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:54.060
The war to end all wars.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.060
Weapons far deadlier than you can ever imagine.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:00.940
I walk in the hours.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:05.800
Wherever you are, you are in more danger than you think.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.880
I cannot stand by while innocent lives are lost.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:13.340
Be careful, Diana.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:15.260
Who is this woman?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.480
She is my, umm... secretary, Sir.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.360
She's a very good secretary.

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:28.180
It is our sacred duty to defend the world

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.000
and that's what I'm going to do.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.000
Diana!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.420
How could a woman possibly fight in this?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.120
Fight? We use our principles.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:19.700
Although, I am not opposed to engaging in

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.920
a bit of fisticuffs should the occasion arise.

